  ('7e4575e5-71a9-561a-a47e-8517c7b16bac'::uuid, '000acbb6-d5bd-520b-93f5-b6c9721d7dc8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'considerably', FALSE, 13, 3, NULL),
  ('3549c36f-db83-59f3-8091-72c503262710'::uuid, '000acbb6-d5bd-520b-93f5-b6c9721d7dc8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'traditionally', FALSE, 14, 3, NULL),
  ('3dfef942-56a6-5a38-a227-96b0832523c2'::uuid, '000acbb6-d5bd-520b-93f5-b6c9721d7dc8'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'practically', FALSE, 15, 3, NULL),
  ('fbf4a3f0-bcc4-5bdc-ae09-5bcd0af96008'::uuid, '0017624d-a1a3-5722-98ac-bb5c9433f051'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Changing existing behavior can be a difficult task, but with the help of these strategies new behaviors can become habitual, facilitating a long-term sustained healthy lifestyle.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('2cddcbac-41f8-5aa4-ba24-0e92c6be4787'::uuid, '0017624d-a1a3-5722-98ac-bb5c9433f051'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Perhaps most importantly, we look to the field of behavioral science for strategies that people can use to overcome those hurdles and to initiate lifestyle changes.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('e9d4eea1-4a48-5c49-831e-f0aa0ff0697f'::uuid, '0017624d-a1a3-5722-98ac-bb5c9433f051'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'In ''Easier Said than Done'', we set out some of the reasons why we might find it hard to live in a healthy way, exercising, eating well, getting adequate sleep, and checking for early warning symptoms.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('7556681b-2093-5156-a59e-5c8a34c05653'::uuid, '0017624d-a1a3-5722-98ac-bb5c9433f051'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'These include Commitment devices, where we make it very unattractive to not follow through on an intention.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('00a96542-f9fa-5a38-bff1-d64f1852157e'::uuid, '0031471a-5f1c-50ed-b377-3d5d62462052'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'But stored food is essential for feeding non-food-producing specialists, and certainly for supporting whole towns of them.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('8933b30d-3fdb-52e5-87ff-21272027d306'::uuid, '0031471a-5f1c-50ed-b377-3d5d62462052'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A consequence of a settled existence is that it permits one to store food surpluses, since storage would be pointless if one didn''t remain nearby to guard the stored food.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('87d13ec0-e349-5bae-a940-69749d811b91'::uuid, '0031471a-5f1c-50ed-b377-3d5d62462052'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Hence nomadic hunter-gatherer societies have few or no such full-time specialists, who instead first appear in sedentary societies.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('ed2d6bdb-14bc-5598-9db5-d8f3802ab2dd'::uuid, '0031471a-5f1c-50ed-b377-3d5d62462052'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'So, while some nomadic hunter-gatherers may occasionally bag more food than they can consume in a few days, such a bonanza is of little use to them because they cannot protect it.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('fb72955e-0a06-5725-ac19-2d65c68164e2'::uuid, '0033ed8d-8c57-5982-80b0-3db3e55c6970'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'What makes people unique compared to other creatures is their hands. Their flexibility has allowed us to develop the manual skills that have made society what it is today. People should become more aware of the complicated anatomy of each of their hands.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('d007aa18-4aed-5885-94cf-0ebff2db3fb8'::uuid, '0033ed8d-8c57-5982-80b0-3db3e55c6970'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The thumb is the part of our hand which is most complicated in ter ms of the number of muscles which are required to control it. However, each of our fingers also depends on a set of nerves and muscles which enables it to carry out an extraordinary variety of different actions.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('af90c7d4-ff09-5b8d-b203-03b4fdbe73f4'::uuid, '0033ed8d-8c57-5982-80b0-3db3e55c6970'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The amazing flexibility of the human hand is truly remarkable. It is the result of a complex anatomy lying under the skin of the hand, and it can be useful to study this anatomy if you want to learn how to use your hands more effectively for sporting or other purposes.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('5e9f95be-f73b-510d-81be-a4cd0f5a3c64'::uuid, '0033ed8d-8c57-5982-80b0-3db3e55c6970'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The human hand is extraordinarily flexible. It enables a person to do a remarkable variety of things, some demanding great precision and others requiring considerable strength. This is because of the complex structure of nerves, muscles and ligaments that makes up a hand.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('08d1ef87-ab54-577a-a729-4dc8d6855944'::uuid, '0035bf87-6a21-578f-866b-32a3edbe3eb9'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-09-23 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'demonstrate', TRUE, 0, 0, NULL),
